    Target               kFoe
    Range                70
    TimeToActivate       1.67
    TimeToRoot           1.67
    RechargeTime         3
    EffectArea           kCharacter
    BoostsAllowed        kAccuracy_Boost, kRecharge_Boost, kRange_Boost, kTaunt_Boost
    VisualFX             "menu\Powers\AnimFX\PlayerPowers\ScrapperMelee_Quills_Taunt.PFX"
